<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13134" root="دملق" body-key="d">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُدَمْلَقٌ</span></b> , applied to a stone, (JK, S, K,) and to
a solid hoof, like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُدَمْلَكٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُدَمْلَجٌ</span>, (S,) and
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دُمَالِقُ</span></b>  (JK, K) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دُمَلِقٌ</span></b>  (K) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَمْلَقٌ</span></b> 
(JK, TA) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دُمْلُوقٌ</span></b> , (JK, K,) <i>Smooth and
round:</i> (S, K:) or <i>very round:</i> (JK:) or,
accord. to Aboo-Kheyreh, ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دُمْلُوقٌ</span></b>  signifies a
stone <i>smooth like the hand,</i> and, some add, <i>hard:</i>
the pl. [of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دُمَالِقٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دُمَلِقٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَمْلَقٌ</span>] is <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَمَالِقُ</span>
and [that of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دُمْلُوقٌ</span> is] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَمَالِيقُ</span>. (TA.)

